<title>USA: Gold Capital  sets vote on merger.</title>
<headline>Gold Capital  sets vote on merger.</headline>
<dateline>COLORADO SPRINGS, Colo. 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gold Capital Corp said Monday it will hold a special shareholders meeting on August 28 to vote on the proposed merger with a subsidiary of Globex Mining Enterprises Inc.</p>
<p>Gold Capital shareholders will receive one Globex share for every 3.6 shares they hold under the merger deal, which the company announced in February.</p>
